#showas:独行超级猫
Extremely difficult scenario. Just you and one AI, which is set to the maximum difficulty of 10.

Map type is "realistic", with 80 planets, pretty much considered the default. The AI is only a Full Ensemble, nothing special.

Your starting fleets are all the default options.

This isn't really meant to be fair.  Even with just a single AI, it's an impressive feat should you manage to succeed.